AIR BRAIN – INTELLIGENT ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING SYSTEM

• Developed an ESP32-based smart environmental monitoring system
• Interfaced gas, temperature, and humidity sensors with ESP32
• Monitored real-time air quality and environmental conditions
• Used IoT connectivity for data transmission and monitoring
• Implemented alert system for unsafe environmental conditions
• Gained hands-on experience in embedded systems and sensor interfacing
• Worked with Arduino IDE and IoT-based programming
• Learned basic AI-based environmental data analysis
• Designed as a low-cost and smart safety solution
• Won 1st Prize among 250+ teams in project competition



• Received appreciation and positive feedback from an ISRO scientist for the project innovation and implementation
